# As of 2026-08-22 this frontend no longer reads an Etherscan API key
# directly (that key used to ship inlined in the built JS bundle — a real
# credential-leak finding, fixed by moving the actual Etherscan HTTP call to
# the Rust backend). To enable transaction history, set ETHERSCAN_API_KEY in
# desktop/src-tauri/.env instead — see that directory's own .env.example.
